@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncident = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobIncident = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@unknownIncident = ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

# Login on auth-lab.html for browser flow. For an HTTP client, login separately
# with a locally supplied password and retain its cookie; do not paste it into Git.
# Automatic real-cookie scenarios are in AuthorizationSecurityTests.

### A-02: authenticated Alice -> own details: 200
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncident}}
Accept: application/json

### A-03: same Alice -> Bob details: 404
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobIncident}}
Accept: application/json

### A-10: same Alice -> unknown: identical 404 after excluding traceId/requestId
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{unknownIncident}}
Accept: application/json

### A-05: Alice -> exactly own incidents
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### A-12: Alice -> Bob child comment-2: 404
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Accept: application/json

### A-12: Alice -> internal comment-3 in own parent: 404
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json

### A-03R: after login as Morgan -> Alice details: 200
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncident}}
Accept: application/json
